A||||9||Urchin||Moment of silence (and respect to Cliff)||||1||
Z||000000||Urchin||09-14-2001||03:09 AM||||This is a very difficult time for all of us.  If not only for those who have been lost in the unfortunate incidents this Tuesday past, but for what the future may hold for us. I just wanted to express respect to Cliff here for paying tribute to all involved by implementing a down time, a time to pay respect.  I would also like to add, that the forum has also provided many of us with a place to deal with and discuss this tragedy.  So, I believe yet another "thanks" is in order as well.  Here's hoping that the future is a positive one.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/final.jpg"> <BR>If you can read this, I'm parked.||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||09-14-2001||05:31 AM||||Amen.||||reg||1
